<comment id="126241" author="557058:bf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058" created="Fri, 27 Jun 2025 08:01:13 -0500"><p><a href="https://lspapp.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A48116bda-7e23-446e-b0b2-e6d15e92dc3a" class="user-hover" rel="712020:48116bda-7e23-446e-b0b2-e6d15e92dc3a" data-account-id="712020:48116bda-7e23-446e-b0b2-e6d15e92dc3a" accountid="712020:48116bda-7e23-446e-b0b2-e6d15e92dc3a" rel="noreferrer">Samuel Rosenberg</a>, please review backend PR below and also another one <a href="https://github.com/boostlingo/boost-core-web-ui/pull/1363" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://github.com/boostlingo/boost-core-web-ui/pull/1363</a> for frontend. </p></comment>
<comment id="126381" author="557058:d005829d-f994-4adf-ac20-54fa72b78108" created="Mon, 30 Jun 2025 16:46:04 -0500"><p><a href="https://lspapp.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Abf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058" class="user-hover" rel="557058:bf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058" data-account-id="557058:bf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058" accountid="557058:bf72cd80-5754-4e78-9de4-bed28880e058" rel="noreferrer">Pavel Savrovsky</a> great question, I forgot about S2S scenario! Yes, we should support this. If it hasn't been implemented in scope of this ticket - let's create a separate one please. Thank you!</p> <p><a href="https://lspapp.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5f80cd5758899e0070c0fdd8" class="user-hover" rel="5f80cd5758899e0070c0fdd8" data-account-id="5f80cd5758899e0070c0fdd8" accountid="5f80cd5758899e0070c0fdd8" rel="noreferrer">Brynn Reilly</a> FYI</p></comment>
